   "note_type": "Policy Condition",
   "serial_no": "2",
   "section": "V",
   "text": "Import of the following kinds of zinc ash/skimmings is permitted without a licence to units registered with Ministry of Environment and Forest, Government of India, on actual user basis upto the annual quantity limits indicated in the registration certificate: (i) Zinc ash in dispersible form containing zinc greater than 65percent and lead and cadmium equal to or less than 1.25percent and 0.1percent respectively; (ii) Zinc skimmings containing zinc 65percent and above, lead and cadmium less than 1.25percent and 0.1percent respectively; (iii) Spent cleaned metal catalyst containing zinc.",
